          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Add the host, SSH port and user. Your key is stored encrypted and never leaves the platform.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs font-mono">deploy@203.0.113.24:22</p>
