          <h3 class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-medium mb-2">Choose your stack</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Pick Tylix, Laravel, PHP, MERN, Angular or your own commands, then point it at your repository.</p>
